## My Machine Learning Workflow

I approach machine learning projects through a structured development process.

<div align="center">

| Stage | Process |
|:--:|:--|
| 01 | Problem Definition |
| 02 | Dataset Selection & Understanding |
| 03 | Data Cleaning & Preprocessing |
| 04 | Exploratory Data Analysis |
| 05 | Feature Engineering |
| 06 | Baseline Model Development |
| 07 | Model Training & Optimization |
| 08 | Validation & Performance Evaluation |
| 09 | Error Analysis & Explainability |
| 10 | Model Serialization & API Integration |
| 11 | Deployment & Monitoring |

</div>

### Engineering Principles

```text
[01] PROBLEM FIRST       Solve a meaningful problem.
[02] DATA QUALITY        Understand the data before modeling.
[03] TRUST THE SPLIT     Prevent leakage and unfair evaluation.
[04] START WITH BASELINES Compare before adding complexity.
[05] MEASURE PERFORMANCE Use appropriate evaluation metrics.
[06] EXPLAIN DECISIONS   Understand predictions and model errors.
[07] BUILD FOR HUMANS    Make intelligent systems accessible.
[08] KEEP ITERATING      Learn from every experiment.
```

